# C++ profile

Parent: [Documentation index](README.md)

The C++ profile requires CMake 3.25 or newer, Ninja and a C++20 compiler. It
creates a small library with an explicit public header, one executable and one
CTest smoke test. The starter uses value-returning APIs and owns no dynamic
resources.

Setup configures an isolated `.build/debug` tree. The quality command configures
again, builds with common compiler warnings and runs CTest.
